      "title": "证券行业廉洁从业细则迎来修订 薪酬追索扣回机制打通“最后一公里” - 同花顺财经",
      "summary": "<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTFBhMWhraTZBMGlyMTdVRlBVQm4yN05MRGRtVDYtOUNicFhKYTVuZ2laLV9ZRFJXMUpEZGN5MHczbDBqWG8xTzgybV96bzFTenRmVWlDV0k4U2d5VXRTdDFYTTBR?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\">证券行业廉洁从业细则迎来修订 薪酬追索扣回机制打通“最后一公里”</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#6f6f6f\">同花顺财经</font>",
